**Finding:** Reconciled 2025 estimate on the primary-only base of 18,660 (Table 1 of arXiv:2602.12303). All within-category fractions are assumptions; none comes from a source or a figure read. Strict: CO 0.15x2789=418, GA 0.06x4761=286, HE 0.04x3869=155, IM 0.03x1722=52, general astro-ph 0.03x268=8, SR and EP 0. Total about 920, range 660-1,250. Low end uses fractions of 12/4/2.5/2/2%; high end uses 20/8/6/4/4%. Broad: CO 0.25x2789=697, GA 0.12x4761=571, HE 0.07x3869=271, IM 0.05x1722=86, astro-ph 0.05x268=13. Total about 1,640, range 1,290 (20/10/5/3/3%) to 2,020 (30/15/9/6/6%), plus gr-qc and hep-ph cross-lists, which are not quantified (q-09). Back-projection to 2024 at constant share, using 16,333 sourced papers (18,660/16,333 = 1.142): strict about 800, broad about 1,430.
